# Animal Sanctuary: "{2}, {T}: Put a +1/+1 counter on target Bird, Cat, Dog, Goat, Ox, or Snake." Bot1 activates it once a turn on a
# different one of the six types - Aven Envoy (Bird), Mountain Goat (Goat), Cauldron Familiar (Cat), Isamaru (Dog), Yoked
# Ox (Ox) and Bot2's Hexdrinker (Snake, so an opponent's permanent is a legal target) - each time paying exactly {2} (the pool
# is empty right after). On turn 1 the Ornithopters of both players, which have none of the six types, are refused, with the Envoy
# as the positive control (CR 115.1, 205.3m). The counters are checked after each ability has resolved.

